From: GreenAutarky OS <noreply@greenautarky.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] meta: product name GreenAutarky BOS, GA version suffix

GA delta of HAOS's meta (until HAOS 18.x an edit of the file itself):
  HAOS_NAME="GreenAutarky BOS"
  VERSION_SUFFIX="1.6"  -> OS version 18.3.1.6, the <HAOS>.<GA> scheme of the
                           16.3 line (16.3.1.10 = BOSv1.5.x). Without it the
                           version is a bare 18.3, which cannot be told apart
                           from upstream's. One value for every board.
---
 buildroot-external/meta | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/buildroot-external/meta b/buildroot-external/meta
index 51a0f91..26f5a10 100644
--- a/buildroot-external/meta
+++ b/buildroot-external/meta
@@ -1,8 +1,8 @@
 VERSION_MAJOR="18"
 VERSION_MINOR="3"
-VERSION_SUFFIX=""
+VERSION_SUFFIX="1.6"
 
-HAOS_NAME="Home Assistant OS"
+HAOS_NAME="GreenAutarky BOS"
 HAOS_ID="haos"
 
 DEPLOYMENT="production"
